Data Engineering:
It is a process where we move the data from one source to another, while transforming, cleaning the data and prepare for businesses.
It is more about research and excueting.


Data Warehouse:
centralized location/ repo where we stored the data from multiple sources. basically it is used to store historical data
it is non volatile.
Characterstics of Datawarehouse: historical data, time travel, non volatile, subject_oriented.


It collects, integrates, and large volume of current and historical data from diverse source to support business Intelligence, 
reporting and data analysis.
ETL tool will work as mediator to insert the data in data warehouse, a data can be from any source ERP's, CRM's and any type csv's, json's,
xlxs, of any type.

SPOT : 
single point of truth(End user can use data from Datawarehouse.)

